flowchart LR
    A[Lead arrives] --> B[Create lead.created event]
    B --> C[Persist deal]
    C --> D[Load segment pack]
    D --> E[Deterministic scoring]
    E --> F[Agent proposes outreach]
    F --> G{Policy decision}
    G -->|DENY| H[Block + audit]
    G -->|AUTO| I[Create outbox item]
    G -->|REQUIRE_APPROVAL| J[Human reviews]
    J -->|Reject| H
    J -->|Approve| I
    I --> K[Delivery worker]
    K --> L{Provider}
    L --> M[Resend email]
    L --> N[Dropbox Sign test request]
    M --> O[Provider ID + audit]
    N --> O
    O --> P[Reply / transcript received]
    P --> Q[Classify + extract lessons]
    Q --> R[Update deal and future context]
